                ['Cloud tax holiday', 'Finance Act 2026, tax years 2026-27 to 2046-47', 'Enacted; the Taxation and Other Laws (Amendment) Act 2026, which eases its conditions, received assent on 17 August 2026'],
                ['Evaluation framework', 'NITI Aayog Frontier Tech Hub, 14 October 2026', 'Guidance only'],
                ['Government capacity figure', 'About 1,575 MW installed (Rajya Sabha reply, 7 August 2026)', 'A parliamentary committee report quotes MeitY as keeping no official capacity data'],
